\ntensioning device.</p><p>Tighten the bolt securing the device to\nthe mount to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>SINGLE SERVICES MOBILE BELT TENSIONER</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2584320\">1092A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584442\">1092G10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584771\">4450B04</a></p>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Place the engine components single drive belt moving tensioner\n(1a) back in its housing and fix it tightening the bolts (1b) to\nthe recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>SINGLE SERVICES MOBILE BELT TENSIONER</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2.3 ÷ 2.8</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021996.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584320\">1092A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584442\">1092G10</a>\n                 